WEBVTT

aai-1
00:00:10.131 --> 00:00:12.716 needsReview
Akkaan jirtu hundi keessan. Torbee kana, ani haala biyyaatiif haasaa taasiseera.

aai-2
00:00:13.216 --> 00:00:15.558 needsReview
Har'a, kunoo kunniin daqiiqaa 3 dha.

aai-3
00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:18.754 needsReview
Waggoota 4 guddina diinaggee booda hojiiwwan dhuunfaa haaraa miliyoona 8 wajjin,

aai-4
00:00:18.802 --> 00:00:21.002 needsReview
qaxarriin keenya waggoota 5 darban keessatti isa gadi aanaadha.

aai-5
00:00:21.502 --> 00:00:23.298 needsReview
Diinaggee saffisiisuu wajjin,

aai-6
00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:25.048 needsReview
dhaabbileen barana namoota dabalataa qaxaruuf akka karoorfatan dubbatu.

aai-7
00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:27.265 needsReview
Garuu warri gubbaa jiran caalaa fooyya'aa jiranis, mindaan giddu-galeessaa hin deebine.

aai-8
00:00:28.116 --> 00:00:30.093 needsReview
Walqixxummaan dhiphateera.

aai-9
00:00:30.221 --> 00:00:32.873 needsReview
Namoonni Ameerikaa baay'een jireenyaaf jette qofaaf harka caalaa hojjechaa jiru,

aai-10
00:00:33.373 --> 00:00:34.849 needsReview
namoonni baay'een ammoo matumaa hin hojjetan.

aai-11
00:00:34.945 --> 00:00:38.143 needsReview
Hojiin keenya haala kana jijjiiruudha.

aai-12
00:00:38.239 --> 00:00:40.601 needsReview
Yeroonsaa namoota hundumaaf carraa deebisuuf gaheera.

aai-13
00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.317 needsReview
Yaadni eenyu akka taate osoo hin taane, yoo cimtee hojjettee fi gaafatamummaa kee baate,

aai-14
00:00:43.817 --> 00:00:46.948 needsReview
yoo yaaljette milkaa'uu dandeessa jedhuutu jira.

aai-15
00:00:47.448 --> 00:00:49.519 needsReview
Sagantaan carraa Kibxata dhiyeesse kutaalee 4 qaba.

aai-16
00:00:50.019 --> 00:00:52.314 needsReview
Torbee kana, karaarratti fudheera.

aai-17
00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:55.060 needsReview
Hojii tokko hojii haaraa dabalataadha - hojii ijaarsaa fi oomishaa; hojii kalaqaa fi anniisaa.

aai-18
00:00:55.124 --> 00:00:56.216 needsReview
Wisconsin keessatti, hojjettoota biqiltuu GE wajjin waa'ee kuta 2ffaa haasa'eera.

aai-19
00:00:56.248 --> 00:00:58.721 needsReview
Ameerikaanota dabalataa dandeettii hojiiwwan haaraa kana guutuuf qaban qopheessuu.

aai-20
00:00:59.221 --> 00:01:01.627 needsReview
Tennessee keessatti, barattoota wajjin waa'ee kuta 3ffaa haasa'eera -

aai-21
00:01:02.127 --> 00:01:04.341 needsReview
daa'imman hundaa barnoota sadarkaa addunyaa irraa hanga kolleejjii fi hanga hojiitti argachuuf mirkaneessuu.

aai-22
00:01:04.357 --> 00:01:07.070 needsReview
Fi hojjettoota sibiilaa Pittsburgh keessatti fi hojjettoota daldala Maryland keessatti,

aai-23
00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.094 needsReview
ani kuta 4ffaa dhiyeesseera - hojiin ulfaataan dhiiraa fi dubartii akka kaffalamu gochuun,

aai-24
00:01:09.158 --> 00:01:11.663 needsReview
mindaa jiraachuu dandeessan, qusannoo hojiirraa gaggeeffamuu dandeessan,

aai-25
00:01:11.727 --> 00:01:14.264 needsReview
fi inshuraansi fayyaa yeroo barbaaddan isiniif jiru wajjin.

aai-26
00:01:14.376 --> 00:01:17.556 needsReview
Yaadni kun kutaa giddu-galeessaa ni jabeessa

aai-27
00:01:17.604 --> 00:01:19.820 needsReview
akkasumas namoonni baay'een gara kutaa giddu-galeessaatti akka hojjetan gargaara.

aai-28
00:01:19.917 --> 00:01:22.856 needsReview
Isaan keessaa tokko tokko Kongiresii barbaadu.

aai-29
00:01:22.888 --> 00:01:25.683 needsReview
Garuu bakkan carraa maatii dabalataaf babal'isuuf tarkaanfii fudhadhu hundatti, nan godha.

aai-30
00:01:25.779 --> 00:01:28.172 needsReview
Hoggantoota daldalaa, hoggantoota barnootaa, fi hoggantoota filantrooppii ni gaafadha

aai-31
00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.437 needsReview
galmoota kana galmaan ga'uuf nu wajjin akka hirmaatan.

aai-32
00:01:30.937 --> 00:01:33.151 needsReview
Guyyaa hunda, dursa kennaman kanaaf lola -

aai-33
00:01:33.183 --> 00:01:35.111 needsReview
carraan kun maatii hojjettootaa fi giddu-galeessaa deebisee akka fayyadamuuf,

aai-34
00:01:35.611 --> 00:01:38.436 needsReview
fi Ameerikaa yoo yaaljette yeroo hunda milkaa'uu dandeessu taasisuuf.

aai-35
00:01:38.548 --> 00:01:41.022 needsReview
Galatoomaa. Torbee gaarii qabaadhaa, fi Super Bowl gammadaa.

